The amount stepper's field on Android: Compose's text field fills its row and draws an outline, so the unit stacked over the number and the outline ran under the minus button; the number and unit split the row and the field is plain, as on iOS

diff --git a/Piru/Views/Tools/Inventory/InventorySupport.swift b/Piru/Views/Tools/Inventory/InventorySupport.swift
